ethods have been adopted by TigerVNC and libvncserver, and TurboVNC is also compatible with any other TightVNC derivative.","name":"TurboVNC","packageUrl":"https://turbovnc.org/","publisher":"The VirtualGL Project","publisherUrl":"https://turbovnc.org/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/TurboVNC/turbovnc/releases/tag/3.1.4","tags":["vnc"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"高速、3D 友好、兼容 TightVNC 的远程桌面软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"TurboVNC 是基于 TightVNC、TigerVNC 和 X.org 的高性能企业级 VNC 版本。\n它包含 Tight 编码的一个变种，经过调整后可在 3D 应用程序 (VirtualGL)、视频和其它图像密集型工作负载实现最高性能和压缩。\nTurboVNC 与 VirtualGL 相结合，为远程显示具有交互性能的 3D 应用程序提供了完整的解决方案。\nTurboVNC 的高速编码方法已被 TigerVNC 和 libvncserver 采用，TurboVNC 还与其它任何 TightVNC 衍生产品兼容。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/TurboVNC/turbovnc/releases/tag/3.1.4","tags":["vnc"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://turbovnc.org/","releaseDate":"2025-02-08","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/TurboVNC/turbovnc/releases/tag/3.1.4","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/v/VirtualGL/TurboVNC/3.1.4/VirtualGL.TurboVNC.yaml","sha256":"d67d7d48714004c920e46520f348de492bf4edea482a6d525c62b250809ea754"},{"path":"manifests/v/VirtualGL/TurboVNC/3.1.4/VirtualGL.TurboVNC.installer.yaml","sha256":"9cc48d004e76aae931d09961ceb02cafeeb42462f6926540ee0825d840d90191"},{"path":"manifests/v/VirtualGL/TurboVNC/3.1.4/VirtualGL.TurboVNC.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"795e8b55ca0e3febd6fb28a97df935beb209f615a2773579b8d149546d3d3835"},{"path":"manifests/v/VirtualGL/TurboVNC/3.1.4/VirtualGL.TurboVNC.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"0fc4d3bb5c9e5f8b7b6c12b51932dbecbc0072357850727dfa4c31004655fbf1"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"3.1.4"}